      <TextObject Name="Text7" Left="160.65" Top="708.75" Width="406.35" Height="94.5" Border.Lines="All" Border.Color="Silver" Text="&lt;b&gt;Andrew&lt;/b&gt; received his BTS commercial in &lt;b&gt;1974&lt;/b&gt; and a Ph.D. in international marketing from the &lt;font color=&quot;red&quot;&gt;University of Dallas&lt;/font&gt; in 1981. He is fluent in &lt;i&gt;French&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;Italian&lt;/i&gt; and reads &lt;i&gt;German&lt;/i&gt;. He joined the company as a sales representative, was promoted to &lt;u&gt;sales manager&lt;/u&gt; in January 1992 and to vice president of sales in March 1993." HorzAlign="Justify" Font="Segoe UI, 9pt" TextRenderType="HtmlTags"/>
